<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>A time of confinement</l><l>To seek the experience</l><l>In being alone with our Lord today</l><l>And speak forth with boldness</l><l>The dreams of our father,</l><l>Discipling the nations to close this age!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
